From dba79af83d23fee649c2e06f62833a2e5ec24c21 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mitch Johnston <mitch.johnston25@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 21:39:19 +1030
Subject: [PATCH] Add player fullscreen button, audio button and music view

Adds patches/0002 with the next part of the Juxtopposed player: a fullscreen window button, an audio track button in the control bar and the restyled music player view. Updates the README status to match.

capture-window.ps1 now keeps the VLC window topmost while capturing, since Windows can refuse SetForegroundWindow and the screenshot would otherwise show whatever window is on top.
